      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wheat_Ridge%2C_Colorado",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Baugh House, a hand‑hewn log cabin turned farmhouse, sits in Wheat Ridge Historic Park and is on the National Register.",
